{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-glossary-compact-closed-category","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:glossary-compact-closed-category","kind":"remark","title":"Compact closed category","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-glossary-symmetric-monoidal-category","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-glossary-rigid-category"],"tags":["glossary","category-theory","monoidal","duality"],"defines":["compact-closed-category"],"text":"glossary-compact-closed-category.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:glossary-compact-closed-category\"></a><p><strong><dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-compact-closed-category\">Compact closed category</dfn>.</strong> A symmetric monoidal category that is also rigid. Since the braiding identifies <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">X \\otimes Y \\cong Y \\otimes X</code>, left duals and right duals coincide.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/notation/glossary-compact-closed-category.md","heading":"Remark","number":"30.2.11","page":"b/rem-glossary-compact-closed-category","qa":{"counts":{"pass":60,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":60},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
